WEBVTT

00:12:29.673 --> 00:12:31.663
Compared to that,

00:12:31.663 --> 00:12:35.737
war, psychologically, in some ways, is easy,

00:12:35.737 --> 00:12:38.234
compared to that kind of alienation.

00:12:38.234 --> 00:12:39.624
That's why they miss it,

00:12:39.624 --> 00:12:42.102
and that's what we have to understand

00:12:42.102 --> 00:12:45.505
and in some ways fix in our society.

00:12:45.505 --> 00:12:48.435
Thank you very much.

00:12:48.435 --> 00:12:51.390
(Applause)